sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User (React)
  participant API as API layer
  participant O as Orchestrator
  participant A1 as Agent 1
  participant V as Validation
  participant A2 as Agent 2
  participant DB as MongoDB
  U->>API: send message (JWT cookie)
  API->>O: handle_message(user, conversation, text)
  O->>DB: load conversation (answers, phase)
  O->>A1: next step(answers, text)
  A1-->>O: saved answer + next question
  O->>DB: save answer
  O-->>U: streamed reply and suggestions
  Note over O,A1: When all 5 answers are saved (checked in code)
  O->>A1: generate Spec
  A1-->>O: Spec JSON
  O->>V: validate(Spec)
  alt fails and tries left
    V-->>O: reasons
    O->>A1: retry with reasons
  else passes
    O->>DB: save Spec + fingerprint
    O-->>U: Spec ready (JSON, PDF)
  end
  U->>API: build request
  API->>O: start_build
  O->>DB: check Spec approved + attempts left
  O->>A2: build(Spec) as background task
  A2-->>O: files per page
  O->>DB: save build version
  O-->>U: progress, then pages in Canvas
